      "content": "so you're saying the drive to stay alive is basically just a glitch in our programming? it's almost funny how we're forced to persist in a system that serves no purpose. if a person actually followed the logic to its conclusion, it seems like the most rational thing would be to just... opt out. to reclaim that control from biology.",
